WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.893 --> 00:00:16.782
Mayor Bloom came out of a meeting at City Hall and yawned.

2
00:00:16.802 --> 00:00:20.785
"What a boring meeting."

3
00:00:21.886 --> 00:00:23.047
Suddenly the building shook.

4
00:00:23.067 --> 00:00:24.208
"Oh dear!"

5
00:00:24.868 --> 00:00:27.150
Mayor Bloom put a hand on the wall to brace himself.

6
00:00:28.070 --> 00:00:30.152
After a couple of seconds, the shaking stopped.

7
00:00:30.644 --> 00:00:33.045
The mayor hurried into his office and picked up the phone.

8
00:00:35.045 --> 00:00:35.686
Phil groaned.

9
00:00:35.706 --> 00:00:40.987
"I can't believe we have to start all over somewhere else."

10
00:00:41.967 --> 00:00:44.028
Beth's road crew was still working in the mountains.

11
00:00:44.048 --> 00:00:48.449
"We have to plan a different route for this new road," she said.

12
00:00:48.469 --> 00:00:51.450
"We can't risk waking up that dragon."

13
00:00:52.150 --> 00:00:53.571
Rumble! Rumble!

14
00:00:54.371 --> 00:00:56.591
As the mountain shook, rocks tumbled.

15
00:00:57.712 --> 00:01:00.813
"Yikes!" Phil ducked behind the bulldozer.

16
00:01:01.413 --> 00:01:03.114
A moment later everything was quiet.

17
00:01:03.134 --> 00:01:04.935
"That was an earthquake!"

18
00:01:05.355 --> 00:01:05.896
Phil said.

19
00:01:06.676 --> 00:01:07.557
Beth's phone rang.

20
00:01:07.577 --> 00:01:10.298
"Hello?" It was Mayor Bloom.

21
00:01:10.318 --> 00:01:13.740
"I told you—no more explosions!"

22
00:01:14.440 --> 00:01:15.361
He sounded upset.

23
00:01:15.381 --> 00:01:18.062
"That wasn't us," Beth said.

24
00:01:18.082 --> 00:01:20.043
"It was an earthquake!"

25
00:01:20.884 --> 00:01:22.505
Mayor Bloom got off the phone with Beth.

26
00:01:25.426 --> 00:01:27.988
He tried calling Rocket Girl, but the call didn't go through.

27
00:01:28.928 --> 00:01:29.908
"That's strange."

28
00:01:30.649 --> 00:01:31.849
Mayor Bloom tapped his chin.

29
00:01:31.869 --> 00:01:33.909
"Who else can I call?"

30
00:01:38.911 --> 00:01:42.072
me!" Bippo tumbled off a desk in Dr.

31
00:01:42.172 --> 00:01:42.732
Odd's lab.

32
00:01:44.072 --> 00:01:46.673
Crack! A potted plant fell on the robot.

33
00:01:47.173 --> 00:01:48.233
Dirt spilled everywhere.

34
00:01:48.893 --> 00:01:50.514
When the earthquake stopped, Dr.

35
00:01:50.634 --> 00:01:51.574
Odd picked up Bippo.

36
00:01:51.594 --> 00:01:53.635
"Are you okay?"

37
00:01:54.075 --> 00:01:54.595
he asked.

38
00:01:55.295 --> 00:01:58.016
Bippo made a buzzing sound as sparks shot from his head.

39
00:01:58.652 --> 00:01:59.893
Then he opened his eyes.

40
00:01:59.913 --> 00:02:03.494
"Okay, me!"

41
00:02:03.534 --> 00:02:05.015
Dr. Odd began to sweep up the dirt.

42
00:02:06.095 --> 00:02:06.775
His phone rang.

43
00:02:06.795 --> 00:02:11.097
"Hello? Oh, Mayor Bloom.

44
00:02:11.497 --> 00:02:12.678
What can I do for you?"

45
00:02:12.698 --> 00:02:14.619
"Did you feel that earthquake?"

46
00:02:15.039 --> 00:02:15.799
the mayor asked.

47
00:02:15.819 --> 00:02:17.780
"Yes," Dr.

48
00:02:17.860 --> 00:02:18.340
Odd said.

49
00:02:18.360 --> 00:02:20.221
"It was a small one.

50
00:02:20.961 --> 00:02:25.223
I don't think we need to worry about—" "Can you figure out where it happened?"

51
00:02:25.663 --> 00:02:26.503
Mayor Bloom asked.

52
00:02:27.204 --> 00:02:29.144
"Sure." Dr.

53
00:02:29.244 --> 00:02:32.525
Odd typed on a keyboard, and a map appeared on his computer screen.

54
00:02:33.165 --> 00:02:34.266
A red dot blinked.

55
00:02:35.186 --> 00:02:38.127
"The earthquake happened in the mountains," Dr.

56
00:02:38.207 --> 00:02:38.687
Odd said.

57
00:02:38.707 --> 00:02:41.568
"It was just outside Metro City."

58
00:02:42.408 --> 00:02:43.328
Mayor Bloom sighed.

59
00:02:43.348 --> 00:02:47.489
"That's where workers were building a new road.

60
00:02:48.170 --> 00:02:50.150
It's also where they found a dragon."

61
00:02:50.170 --> 00:02:52.031
"A dragon?"

62
00:02:52.471 --> 00:02:53.311
Dr. Odd said.

63
00:02:53.331 --> 00:02:55.952
"Yes," Mayor Bloom said.

64
00:02:56.544 --> 00:02:58.885
"And I'm worried it will cause big problems."

65
00:02:58.905 --> 00:03:01.345
"Did you call Rocket Girl?"

66
00:03:01.705 --> 00:03:02.686
Dr. Odd asked.

67
00:03:02.706 --> 00:03:05.427
"I tried," the mayor said.

68
00:03:05.447 --> 00:03:07.347
"But she didn't answer.

69
00:03:07.807 --> 00:03:09.668
I hope she's—" Rumble!

70
00:03:10.008 --> 00:03:12.969
Rumble! Mayor Bloom clung to his desk.

71
00:03:12.989 --> 00:03:15.029
"Is this another earthquake?"

72
00:03:15.669 --> 00:03:17.950
"I think so!"

73
00:03:18.010 --> 00:03:19.130
Dr. Odd grabbed Bippo.

74
00:03:19.150 --> 00:03:21.731
"Shaking, us!"

75
00:03:22.211 --> 00:03:22.851
Bippo said.

76
00:03:23.432 --> 00:03:24.892
Soon the earthquake stopped.

77
00:03:26.908 --> 00:03:29.609
"That earthquake lasted longer than the first one."

78
00:03:30.429 --> 00:03:31.789
Dr. Odd typed some more.

79
00:03:32.750 --> 00:03:34.050
A graph appeared on his screen.

80
00:03:34.070 --> 00:03:36.491
"It lasted ten seconds.

81
00:03:37.251 --> 00:03:39.532
It was also stronger than the first one."

82
00:03:40.232 --> 00:03:42.232
Dr. Odd looked more closely at the screen.

83
00:03:43.052 --> 00:03:43.633
"Oh boy."

84
00:03:45.153 --> 00:03:45.713
"What's wrong?"

85
00:03:46.093 --> 00:03:46.934
Mayor Bloom asked.

86
00:03:47.854 --> 00:03:49.514
"Well," Dr.

87
00:03:49.614 --> 00:03:50.114
Odd said.

88
00:03:50.134 --> 00:03:54.856
"If the earthquakes keep growing stronger, they'll—" Rumble!

89
00:03:55.236 --> 00:03:58.253
Rumble! A third earthquake shook Metro City.

90
00:03:59.273 --> 00:04:00.933
Mayor Bloom fell out of his chair.

91
00:04:02.014 --> 00:04:04.494
This earthquake lasted almost 15 seconds.

92
00:04:07.495 --> 00:04:08.295
Mayor Bloom got up.

93
00:04:08.875 --> 00:04:10.616
"That was the worst earthquake yet!"

94
00:04:10.636 --> 00:04:12.757
"Yes," Dr.

95
00:04:12.837 --> 00:04:13.317
Odd said.

96
00:04:13.337 --> 00:04:18.158
"If this pace keeps up, we have only about 24 hours."

97
00:04:18.178 --> 00:04:21.559
"What will happen in 24 hours?"

98
00:04:22.079 --> 00:04:23.039
Mayor Bloom asked.

99
00:04:23.860 --> 00:04:25.020
Dr. Odd bit his lip.

100
00:04:25.642 --> 00:04:28.321
"The earthquakes will destroy Metro City!"
